(5007544, 729891, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Great capture - Loved the muted colours and expressions. Very nice. May have liked to see a slightly wider shot to show some of the environment that they are living in to add just a little more of that suburbia feel. Nice and sharp too</td>', 'Nice image - Great capture - Loved the muted colours and expressions. Very nice. May have liked to see a slightly wider shot to show some of the environment that they are living in to add just a little more of that suburbia feel. Nice and sharp too', '2008-10-14 03:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
