(5007548, 730559, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Like the interesting lighting - Not screaming suburbia to me like some of the other images but very nice tones.</td>', 'Nice image - Like the interesting lighting - Not screaming suburbia to me like some of the other images but very nice tones.', '2008-10-14 03:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007549, 730456, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Great warm lighting and nice soft feel to this. I find the banister though cuts the image almost in half and thats a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice image - Great warm lighting and nice soft feel to this. I find the banister though cuts the image almost in half and thats a little distracting.', '2008-10-14 03:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007551, 729104, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - I like this a lot - I don''t mind that it''s not tack sharp as I think this adds to the whole feel of this rather depressing image. I tried cropping this several ways as the composition seemed a little awkward with either too much sky or too much foreground but found nothing helped make it better - I then looked back at your original crop and feel that really is the best way for this image. Yep I really like this one.</td>', 'Nice image - I like this a lot - I don''t mind that it''s not tack sharp as I think this adds to the whole feel of this rather depressing image. I tried cropping this several ways as the composition seemed a little awkward with either too much sky or too much foreground but found nothing helped make it better - I then looked back at your original crop and feel that really is the best way for this image. Yep I really like this one.', '2008-10-14 03:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007553, 730304, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image with nice lighting and tones. Not screaming suburbia to me and maybe the subject matter and composition is a little boring. The hotspot in the middle of the frame is also a little too distracting.</td>', 'Nice sharp image with nice lighting and tones. Not screaming suburbia to me and maybe the subject matter and composition is a little boring. The hotspot in the middle of the frame is also a little too distracting.', '2008-10-14 04:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007554, 730437, 57378, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting on this and the soft tones but feel this is totally let down by lack of composition and a slightly boring angle.</td>', 'Like the lighting on this and the soft tones but feel this is totally let down by lack of composition and a slightly boring angle.', '2008-10-14 04:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007556, 730569, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - I like this - Shows an interesting angle and the colours look great. The over flashed rake is a little too harsh for my liking and the background is a tad messy and distracting.I do like the feel of this though.</td>', 'Nice image - I like this - Shows an interesting angle and the colours look great. The over flashed rake is a little too harsh for my liking and the background is a tad messy and distracting.I do like the feel of this though.', '2008-10-14 04:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007558, 730163, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice angles and lighting but find the composition a little boring</td>', 'Nice angles and lighting but find the composition a little boring', '2008-10-14 04:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007561, 730479, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Like the lighting and colours of this. Composition is a little boring and I think cropping off the grass from the right tightens the overall feel of this and concentrates our eyes to the homes rather than to the bottom of the frame which is light and competing for our attention and dragging our eye down and out of the frame.</td>', 'Nice image - Like the lighting and colours of this. Composition is a little boring and I think cropping off the grass from the right tightens the overall feel of this and concentrates our eyes to the homes rather than to the bottom of the frame which is light and competing for our attention and dragging our eye down and out of the frame.', '2008-10-14 04:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007562, 729646, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Like the tones of this but the border is a little distracting due to it''s thickness and the lack of sharpness in the tree makes it hard for our eyes to go beyond to the homes. Maybe just a bit too much PP work. Love the composition though which many of the other entires are lacking.</td>', 'Nice image - Like the tones of this but the border is a little distracting due to it''s thickness and the lack of sharpness in the tree makes it hard for our eyes to go beyond to the homes. Maybe just a bit too much PP work. Love the composition though which many of the other entires are lacking.', '2008-10-14 04:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007563, 730240, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Great PP - Would be interested how it is done! Like the composition and colours - Doesn''t scream suburbia to me as much as some images - Maybe a little more of their environment could have helped this - Still a very pleasing image though</td>', 'Nice image - Great PP - Would be interested how it is done! Like the composition and colours - Doesn''t scream suburbia to me as much as some images - Maybe a little more of their environment could have helped this - Still a very pleasing image though', '2008-10-14 04:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007566, 730499, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Like the tones and softness to this. Composition feels a little awkward as the two out of focus rocks are protruding into the frame quite a bit and their out of focusness is distracting plus the bright rock ae the bottom of the frame takes our eyes down and away from the main subject.</td>', 'Nice image - Like the tones and softness to this. Composition feels a little awkward as the two out of focus rocks are protruding into the frame quite a bit and their out of focusness is distracting plus the bright rock ae the bottom of the frame takes our eyes down and away from the main subject.', '2008-10-14 04:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007568, 730477, 57378, '<td valign="top">I like the over saturated colours here but the lack of sharpness and out of focus trees are too distracting.</td>', 'I like the over saturated colours here but the lack of sharpness and out of focus trees are too distracting.', '2008-10-14 04:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007569, 730104, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Like the lighting and soft tones here. The cut off shadow and rather busy background are very distracting though. The bike gets a little lost in the boats</td>', 'Nice image - Like the lighting and soft tones here. The cut off shadow and rather busy background are very distracting though. The bike gets a little lost in the boats', '2008-10-14 04:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007572, 730568, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Nice lighting and soft colours - Composition is a little awkward - I think cropping some off the top really helps us concentrate on the houses rather than taking our eyes up and out of the frame.</td>', 'Nice image - Nice lighting and soft colours - Composition is a little awkward - I think cropping some off the top really helps us concentrate on the houses rather than taking our eyes up and out of the frame.', '2008-10-14 04:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5007575, 730533, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Love the PP on this and the dog is great. Not screaming suburbia to me - More of a portrait. Maybe a little more of the surroundings could ahve helped. Great tones and sharpness.</td>', 'Nice image - Love the PP on this and the dog is great. Not screaming suburbia to me - More of a portrait. Maybe a little more of the surroundings could ahve helped. Great tones and sharpness.', '2008-10-14 04:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
