(5007580, 730157, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Like the colours and POV - Well done on making the effort and making a boring subject interesting with your creative eye. The one distraction though is the blown out highlight to the top right. Really takes our eye away from the main subject and out of the frame. Still very nice though.</td>', 'Nice image - Like the colours and POV - Well done on making the effort and making a boring subject interesting with your creative eye. The one distraction though is the blown out highlight to the top right. Really takes our eye away from the main subject and out of the frame. Still very nice though.', '2008-10-14 04:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
