(5007585, 730308, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice image - Like the POV and the soft tones. I also like the contrasts between old and new living. I think the horse with his head down though is a little distracting as he looks headless.</td>', 'Nice image - Like the POV and the soft tones. I also like the contrasts between old and new living. I think the horse with his head down though is a little distracting as he looks headless.', '2008-10-14 04:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
