(5007608, 730550, 57378, '<td valign="top">Like the simple composition and angle. Maybe needs a little more exposure though so we can see into the top left houses.</td>', 'Like the simple composition and angle. Maybe needs a little more exposure though so we can see into the top left houses.', '2008-10-14 04:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
