(5008555, 728972, 19734, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and spacing with the sky. The airplane is a little distracting, but adds to the feel of the suburbs.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and spacing with the sky. The airplane is a little distracting, but adds to the feel of the suburbs.', '2008-10-14 23:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008556, 730499, 19734, '<td valign="top">I get distracted by the focus and clarity on the rocks. My eyes get lost before they get to the subject of the picture. Beautiful shot though!</td>', 'I get distracted by the focus and clarity on the rocks. My eyes get lost before they get to the subject of the picture. Beautiful shot though!', '2008-10-14 23:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008558, 730088, 19734, '<td valign="top">Definitely matches the challenge, but it lacks draw and intrigue.</td>', 'Definitely matches the challenge, but it lacks draw and intrigue.', '2008-10-14 23:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008561, 730515, 19734, '<td valign="top">The colors look great with the exposure, especially the lighting on the trees behind the house. Great job matching the challenge and keeping it interesting!</td>', 'The colors look great with the exposure, especially the lighting on the trees behind the house. Great job matching the challenge and keeping it interesting!', '2008-10-14 23:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008562, 730393, 19734, '<td valign="top">The perspective is great and the lines bring the eyes all around the pictures. The detail on the house and trees seem a little blurry though.</td>', 'The perspective is great and the lines bring the eyes all around the pictures. The detail on the house and trees seem a little blurry though.', '2008-10-14 23:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008565, 730497, 19734, '<td valign="top">The editing makes the picture seem like a wall print from an old diner; the image has a great feel!</td>', 'The editing makes the picture seem like a wall print from an old diner; the image has a great feel!', '2008-10-14 23:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008568, 730553, 19734, '<td valign="top">Huge congratulations for capturing such a great image. The deer, the tractor, the people, the great foliage make the picture so interesting. I only have to hold back a little because the picture has such a far rural feel for the challenge.</td>', 'Huge congratulations for capturing such a great image. The deer, the tractor, the people, the great foliage make the picture so interesting. I only have to hold back a little because the picture has such a far rural feel for the challenge.', '2008-10-14 23:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008571, 730501, 19734, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and detail on the building. The power lines are both interesting but a little distracting.</td>', 'Great lighting and detail on the building. The power lines are both interesting but a little distracting.', '2008-10-14 23:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008573, 730477, 19734, '<td valign="top">I like the emphasis with the saturation of the houses. The image is a little blurry though.</td>', 'I like the emphasis with the saturation of the houses. The image is a little blurry though.', '2008-10-14 23:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008577, 730562, 19734, '<td valign="top">You were able to make what should be such a simple subject surprisingly interesting with the use of such a stark contrast. The latches, hinges, shadows, and dark grass all play so well of the bright white of the fence.</td>', 'You were able to make what should be such a simple subject surprisingly interesting with the use of such a stark contrast. The latches, hinges, shadows, and dark grass all play so well of the bright white of the fence.', '2008-10-14 23:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008580, 730442, 19734, '<td valign="top">Amazing color and detail! Great shot</td>', 'Amazing color and detail! Great shot', '2008-10-14 23:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008581, 730569, 19734, '<td valign="top">Great color on the leaves and grass; the picture really pops. The background is a little muted and busy and distracts from the subject.</td>', 'Great color on the leaves and grass; the picture really pops. The background is a little muted and busy and distracts from the subject.', '2008-10-14 23:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008583, 730541, 19734, '<td valign="top">Perfect captures of the challenge. The 90 degree flip really keeps it interesting and adds a lot more than if it were still horizontal. Also, having the image against the overcast sky really makes you feel that blah feeling the suburbs can carry. Great job!</td>', 'Perfect captures of the challenge. The 90 degree flip really keeps it interesting and adds a lot more than if it were still horizontal. Also, having the image against the overcast sky really makes you feel that blah feeling the suburbs can carry. Great job!', '2008-10-14 23:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008585, 730508, 19734, '<td valign="top">The dodge of the three people and pumpkin/door and the burn of the house and car are a little too drastic in my opinion. On the same token, the image really feels like a print or painting. Great feeling of the suburbs.</td>', 'The dodge of the three people and pumpkin/door and the burn of the house and car are a little too drastic in my opinion. On the same token, the image really feels like a print or painting. Great feeling of the suburbs.', '2008-10-14 23:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008587, 728891, 19734, '<td valign="top">The blacks and whites play wonderfully together here! The detail and faded dinginess of the dock are beautiful. Great shot!</td>', 'The blacks and whites play wonderfully together here! The detail and faded dinginess of the dock are beautiful. Great shot!', '2008-10-14 23:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008591, 730500, 19734, '<td valign="top">The shadows take away a lot from the picture and nothing sticks out as a main subject to keep interest. The colors really help bring out the feeling of the suburbs though.</td>', 'The shadows take away a lot from the picture and nothing sticks out as a main subject to keep interest. The colors really help bring out the feeling of the suburbs though.', '2008-10-14 23:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008593, 730479, 19734, '<td valign="top">The line of the shadows is perfect to emphasize the colors of the left part of the street and keep the eyes moving smoothly through the pictures. Great job capturing the uniformity of the suburbs while keeping it interesting!</td>', 'The line of the shadows is perfect to emphasize the colors of the left part of the street and keep the eyes moving smoothly through the pictures. Great job capturing the uniformity of the suburbs while keeping it interesting!', '2008-10-14 23:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008595, 729646, 19734, '<td valign="top">Great subject for the challenge! The detail seems to be lost through in processing and lots of halo around some edges.</td>', 'Great subject for the challenge! The detail seems to be lost through in processing and lots of halo around some edges.', '2008-10-14 23:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008598, 730392, 19734, '<td valign="top">The image feels a little off kilter as the horizon drops to the left a little much. The colors are amazing!</td>', 'The image feels a little off kilter as the horizon drops to the left a little much. The colors are amazing!', '2008-10-14 23:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008601, 730487, 19734, '<td valign="top">This definitely feels like the suburbs! There is no main subject to identify with for me; the blinds are twisted and all have different shading and it is difficult to see anything through the screen.</td>', 'This definitely feels like the suburbs! There is no main subject to identify with for me; the blinds are twisted and all have different shading and it is difficult to see anything through the screen.', '2008-10-14 23:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008607, 730528, 19734, '<td valign="top">Definitely a super place for the suburbs! The image is beautiful and almost shows too much character to match the uniformity of the suburbs.</td>', 'Definitely a super place for the suburbs! The image is beautiful and almost shows too much character to match the uniformity of the suburbs.', '2008-10-14 23:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008608, 730432, 19734, '<td valign="top">Its hard not to laugh when you read that. The pop of the color against the gray sky is perfect!</td>', 'Its hard not to laugh when you read that. The pop of the color against the gray sky is perfect!', '2008-10-14 23:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008611, 730335, 19734, '<td valign="top">the posterizing on the grass is a little distracting and th sign seems over detailed compared to the rest of the image. Great match of the subject through!</td>', 'the posterizing on the grass is a little distracting and th sign seems over detailed compared to the rest of the image. Great match of the subject through!', '2008-10-14 23:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008613, 730282, 19734, '<td valign="top">The angle really keeps the picture interesting! The white off the first boat and reflection in the water seems a little over exposed compared to the rest of the image. I would have loved more detail/light/color on the houses.</td>', 'The angle really keeps the picture interesting! The white off the first boat and reflection in the water seems a little over exposed compared to the rest of the image. I would have loved more detail/light/color on the houses.', '2008-10-14 23:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008617, 730550, 19734, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the image and the angle really adds a lot to the image! I feel there is too much light from the windows though or not enough light on the houses and makes that part of the image imbalanced.</td>', 'Great idea for the image and the angle really adds a lot to the image! I feel there is too much light from the windows though or not enough light on the houses and makes that part of the image imbalanced.', '2008-10-14 23:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008680, 730487, 97225, '<td valign="top">I love this interpretation and I like the lighting.</td>', 'I love this interpretation and I like the lighting.', '2008-10-15 00:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008682, 730502, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice to see that it can go that way and not just relentless expansion.</td>', 'Nice to see that it can go that way and not just relentless expansion.', '2008-10-15 00:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008683, 730556, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2008-10-15 00:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5008684, 730432, 97225, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like a slow child, does it. You have got good lighting on that without any flash glare  and that wouldn''t be easy with the sun behind the sign.</td>', 'Doesn''t look like a slow child, does it. You have got good lighting on that without any flash glare  and that wouldn''t be easy with the sun behind the sign.', '2008-10-15 00:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
