(5009376, 730555, 85451, '<td valign="top">This gets my vote for the blue! The tilted angle and crisp colours definitely set it apart from the others in the challenge. 10</td>', 'This gets my vote for the blue! The tilted angle and crisp colours definitely set it apart from the others in the challenge. 10', '2008-10-15 09:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009386, 730335, 85451, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture but i''m not sure I like the comic book type post processing on it. Hmmm maybe I do because i''m still looking at it... one thing i''d like to have seen is a widescreen type border. I imagine it would have fit the PP better. 6</td>', 'Interesting picture but i''m not sure I like the comic book type post processing on it. Hmmm maybe I do because i''m still looking at it... one thing i''d like to have seen is a widescreen type border. I imagine it would have fit the PP better. 6', '2008-10-15 09:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009388, 730452, 85451, '<td valign="top">looks like a scene from a horror movie =0</td>', 'looks like a scene from a horror movie =0', '2008-10-15 09:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009396, 730511, 85451, '<td valign="top">You know, I love the style of the photo. My only gripe is what makes a wedding suburban?</td>', 'You know, I love the style of the photo. My only gripe is what makes a wedding suburban?', '2008-10-15 09:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009398, 730533, 85451, '<td valign="top">God do i know that feeling, just don''t tell my girlfriend i said that...</td>', 'God do i know that feeling, just don''t tell my girlfriend i said that...', '2008-10-15 10:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009400, 730427, 85451, '<td valign="top">I think the shot could have been much better if it wasn''t for the hotspot on the wall and where the sun is. The wall is very interesting but the hotspot just kills it.</td>', 'I think the shot could have been much better if it wasn''t for the hotspot on the wall and where the sun is. The wall is very interesting but the hotspot just kills it.', '2008-10-15 10:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009407, 730164, 85451, '<td valign="top">My vote for the red! 9!</td>', 'My vote for the red! 9!', '2008-10-15 10:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009410, 728936, 85451, '<td valign="top">One of the three I think should and will ribbon! My only gripe is that the contrast seems just a little too sharp, but then again i''m still giving you a 9... so what do I know? =)</td>', 'One of the three I think should and will ribbon! My only gripe is that the contrast seems just a little too sharp, but then again i''m still giving you a 9... so what do I know? =)', '2008-10-15 10:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009426, 730498, 6999, '<td valign="top">For all the slightly clumsy composition - the overlap of the dog and the child, and the dynamic of the figures that takes us straight out of frame - there is certainly something that speaks of suburbia here.</td>', 'For all the slightly clumsy composition - the overlap of the dog and the child, and the dynamic of the figures that takes us straight out of frame - there is certainly something that speaks of suburbia here.', '2008-10-15 10:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009431, 730444, 6999, '<td valign="top">That''s really right up the street, isn''t it? There''s always something slightly sinister about the suburban ideal of the neighbourhood, I think. You might usefully have tried to pull back some of the near-overexposure in the shot: might have enriched some of the deeper tones, and the sky, for a little more impact.</td>', 'That''s really right up the street, isn''t it? There''s always something slightly sinister about the suburban ideal of the neighbourhood, I think. You might usefully have tried to pull back some of the near-overexposure in the shot: might have enriched some of the deeper tones, and the sky, for a little more impact.', '2008-10-15 10:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009436, 730555, 6999, '<td valign="top">You''ll doubtless get a bunch of don''t like the tilt comments: well, neither do I much. I think, along with what looks like pretty heavy handed processing in the shadows and around the mailboxes, it smacks of a desperation to add some drama - whereas, from the look of that street, the seperate avoidance of drama is what it''s all about.</td>', 'You''ll doubtless get a bunch of don''t like the tilt comments: well, neither do I much. I think, along with what looks like pretty heavy handed processing in the shadows and around the mailboxes, it smacks of a desperation to add some drama - whereas, from the look of that street, the seperate avoidance of drama is what it''s all about.', '2008-10-15 10:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009441, 730394, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not unpleasant, if slightly orthodox, exactly-what-you''d-expect kind of shot. I wonder if you might not have strengthened the tonality of the hanging leaves a little, they seem a touch washed-out for impact. Strong sense of composition, however.</td>', 'Not unpleasant, if slightly orthodox, exactly-what-you''d-expect kind of shot. I wonder if you might not have strengthened the tonality of the hanging leaves a little, they seem a touch washed-out for impact. Strong sense of composition, however.', '2008-10-15 10:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009443, 729646, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like this, although the strange colouration possibly adds a sense of mistake rather than intent to it. The point is pretty nicely made too.</td>', 'Like this, although the strange colouration possibly adds a sense of mistake rather than intent to it. The point is pretty nicely made too.', '2008-10-15 10:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009448, 730146, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxtaposition of tonality - the walls and the site background, making it difficult to be quite sure where the image ends and the site begins. I''m not sure the New Worlders won''t think you''re outside the challenge guidelines either - perhaps more urban than sub-. Excellent sense of composition though.</td>', 'Interesting juxtaposition of tonality - the walls and the site background, making it difficult to be quite sure where the image ends and the site begins. I''m not sure the New Worlders won''t think you''re outside the challenge guidelines either - perhaps more urban than sub-. Excellent sense of composition though.', '2008-10-15 10:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009451, 730541, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting - let''s say ''arresting'' approach; after a while looking, I have to say I don;t quite think it succeeds - perhaps simply because its subject is too plain, so that, even rotated, it''s plainly just a bunch of row-houses turned through 90 degrees. The point is, it absolutely feels like a posting mistake, rather than an artistic statement.</td>', 'Interesting - let''s say ''arresting'' approach; after a while looking, I have to say I don;t quite think it succeeds - perhaps simply because its subject is too plain, so that, even rotated, it''s plainly just a bunch of row-houses turned through 90 degrees. The point is, it absolutely feels like a posting mistake, rather than an artistic statement.', '2008-10-15 10:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009452, 730335, 6999, '<td valign="top">Posterization, huh?</td>', 'Posterization, huh?', '2008-10-15 10:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009455, 729442, 6999, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if you''d allowed his reflection to be non-desaturatede also, there would be something here for me: as it is, it feels like the only way you could isolate this subject, and even then you have the piece of bent metal in front of him. Hold very little for me, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Perhaps if you''d allowed his reflection to be non-desaturatede also, there would be something here for me: as it is, it feels like the only way you could isolate this subject, and even then you have the piece of bent metal in front of him. Hold very little for me, I''m afraid.', '2008-10-15 10:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009456, 730161, 6999, '<td valign="top">Has that delightfully fake air about it that really speaks to me of suburbia. Not a line out of place, nor a hint that wood might naturally warp over time. Nicely invidious photograph.</td>', 'Has that delightfully fake air about it that really speaks to me of suburbia. Not a line out of place, nor a hint that wood might naturally warp over time. Nicely invidious photograph.', '2008-10-15 10:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009459, 730510, 6999, '<td valign="top">Now I''m a black and white fan - but there could have been more impact in the grass? It has become a pretty bland tonal field, and perhaps a touch more definition would have grabbed the passing voter the more? And in colour, of course ... well, quite an interesting thought to remove the gifts of that medium. I''m not sure black and white isn''t too dramatic for suburbia, anyhow.</td>', 'Now I''m a black and white fan - but there could have been more impact in the grass? It has become a pretty bland tonal field, and perhaps a touch more definition would have grabbed the passing voter the more? And in colour, of course ... well, quite an interesting thought to remove the gifts of that medium. I''m not sure black and white isn''t too dramatic for suburbia, anyhow.', '2008-10-15 10:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009472, 730569, 93617, '<td valign="top">typical suburbia</td>', 'typical suburbia', '2008-10-15 10:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009474, 728993, 6999, '<td valign="top">See, this would really go into my personal categorisation as ''Urban''. With <i>at least</i> an intitial capital. It''s a great shot, powerfully dynamic and compositionally strong. Love the detail of it, too.</td>', 'See, this would really go into my personal categorisation as ''Urban''. With at least an intitial capital. It''s a great shot, powerfully dynamic and compositionally strong. Love the detail of it, too.', '2008-10-15 10:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5009928, 730394, 98187, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful!</td>', 'this is beautiful!', '2008-10-15 14:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010255, 730541, 98141, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the unconventional orientation of this pic.</td>', 'I enjoy the unconventional orientation of this pic.', '2008-10-15 17:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010276, 730477, 98141, '<td valign="top">I really like the birds against the sky, but the rest of it is so dark and hard to make out (woods) and the suburbs look strange to me with that lighting/post effect, whether intended or accidental.</td>', 'I really like the birds against the sky, but the rest of it is so dark and hard to make out (woods) and the suburbs look strange to me with that lighting/post effect, whether intended or accidental.', '2008-10-15 17:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010281, 730510, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think I would like more it if the house at the very end was in focus. And with all that grass and sky, color could have been really eye-catching with this one.</td>', 'I think I would like more it if the house at the very end was in focus. And with all that grass and sky, color could have been really eye-catching with this one.', '2008-10-15 17:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010504, 730553, 96534, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, but to me its DNMC, it feels more like country rather than suburbia.</td>', 'I love this shot, but to me its DNMC, it feels more like country rather than suburbia.', '2008-10-15 19:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010508, 730456, 96534, '<td valign="top">Wow, amazing shot. Did you use Lucasarts to get the effects?</td>', 'Wow, amazing shot. Did you use Lucasarts to get the effects?', '2008-10-15 19:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010513, 730175, 96534, '<td valign="top">Love the and painted effect on the houses, although I would probably prefer to see more of a blend between houses and sky - they seem almost like 2 separate photos in terms of texture and light.</td>', 'Love the and painted effect on the houses, although I would probably prefer to see more of a blend between houses and sky - they seem almost like 2 separate photos in terms of texture and light.', '2008-10-15 19:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010518, 729636, 96534, '<td valign="top">Wow, your suburbs are very different from ours. Love the shot and the colour selection choice.</td>', 'Wow, your suburbs are very different from ours. Love the shot and the colour selection choice.', '2008-10-15 19:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010526, 730508, 96534, '<td valign="top">This looks like one of those 60''s drawings of ''what life could be like in the future at ...... estate''. Very typical suburban shot, I love the couple arguing while young Peter defends the world with his pink light saber (crayon?), and the pumpkin on the step - perfect. Great editing (how did you do it????), well done, I''m giving it a 10</td>', 'This looks like one of those 60''s drawings of ''what life could be like in the future at ...... estate''. Very typical suburban shot, I love the couple arguing while young Peter defends the world with his pink light saber (crayon?), and the pumpkin on the step - perfect. Great editing (how did you do it????), well done, I''m giving it a 10', '2008-10-15 19:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010531, 730394, 96534, '<td valign="top">This shot jumped out at me when it came up - extraordinary colours and full, lush feeling.</td>', 'This shot jumped out at me when it came up - extraordinary colours and full, lush feeling.', '2008-10-15 19:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010544, 730157, 96534, '<td valign="top">great DPC shot, its got ''stock photo'' written all over it. The colours are great, although I wish the light wasn''t blown out on the top right</td>', 'great DPC shot, its got ''stock photo'' written all over it. The colours are great, although I wish the light wasn''t blown out on the top right', '2008-10-15 19:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010551, 728993, 96534, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, you should have put this in the October free study - it smacks too much of city for me. I''m scoring high anyway, hope others do too.</td>', 'Fantastic shot, you should have put this in the October free study - it smacks too much of city for me. I''m scoring high anyway, hope others do too.', '2008-10-15 19:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010560, 730164, 96534, '<td valign="top">lol, this one made me laugh. The look on her face!!!!!</td>', 'lol, this one made me laugh. The look on her face!!!!!', '2008-10-15 19:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010563, 730501, 96534, '<td valign="top">love the contrast, the angles and that looming sky</td>', 'love the contrast, the angles and that looming sky', '2008-10-15 19:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010565, 730533, 96534, '<td valign="top">hahahahaha. Even the dog is laughing!</td>', 'hahahahaha. Even the dog is laughing!', '2008-10-15 19:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010570, 730500, 96534, '<td valign="top">The angle is good and I know what you''re getting at, but I think it could have done with some post prod fill light to lessen the darkness of the shadows, and some recovery to deepen the sky - or a ND filter</td>', 'The angle is good and I know what you''re getting at, but I think it could have done with some post prod fill light to lessen the darkness of the shadows, and some recovery to deepen the sky - or a ND filter', '2008-10-15 19:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010576, 730510, 96534, '<td valign="top">I love this shot - especially the wave pattern in the sky, its very looming.</td>', 'I love this shot - especially the wave pattern in the sky, its very looming.', '2008-10-15 19:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
