(5010818, 730435, 66041, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.   Enjoy the use of sepia.  I wish the houses had a little more contrast, but it''s not detracting (and may be emphasizing your subject a bit more, which is a good thing  ;-)</td>', 'Nice shot.   Enjoy the use of sepia.  I wish the houses had a little more contrast, but it''s not detracting (and may be emphasizing your subject a bit more, which is a good thing  ;-)', '2008-10-15 23:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
