(5013140, 729891, 54645, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. I have nothing to add except great capture.</td>', 'Wonderful image. I have nothing to add except great capture.', '2008-10-18 01:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013145, 730161, 54645, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant. The bright sun works as creates interesting movement and symmetry in the shadows without distracting from the image (for the most part!). Thanks for not going crazy with the USM (I''m guilty of this as well). I''m not sure how this will score, but I like it!</td>', 'Simple, elegant. The bright sun works as creates interesting movement and symmetry in the shadows without distracting from the image (for the most part!). Thanks for not going crazy with the USM (I''m guilty of this as well). I''m not sure how this will score, but I like it!', '2008-10-18 02:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013148, 730104, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the grungy tone of the image. Overall, I just don''t get the story you are trying to express based on the title. <br/>I''ll be interested to read the details and what marina constitutes a suburb. I wish my suburb had a marina!</td>', 'I like the grungy tone of the image. Overall, I just don''t get the story you are trying to express based on the title. I''ll be interested to read the details and what marina constitutes a suburb. I wish my suburb had a marina!', '2008-10-18 02:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013149, 729646, 54645, '<td valign="top">Too much sharpening.</td>', 'Too much sharpening.', '2008-10-18 02:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013150, 730555, 54645, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the vertigo! I love the soft feel, although the tranquility just went flying out of my left ear when I was forced to tilt my head! :)</td>', 'Thanks for the vertigo! I love the soft feel, although the tranquility just went flying out of my left ear when I was forced to tilt my head! :)', '2008-10-18 02:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013154, 730508, 54645, '<td valign="top">Just say no! You don''t need to mow the lawn, rake the leaves, and wash the car on Saturday! Be your own man, just say no! (...and watch that kid before he gets squashed by a car!)If the you child is the subject, he is too far left in the composition. The adults are the subject in this composition.</td>', 'Just say no! You don''t need to mow the lawn, rake the leaves, and wash the car on Saturday! Be your own man, just say no! (...and watch that kid before he gets squashed by a car!)If the you child is the subject, he is too far left in the composition. The adults are the subject in this composition.', '2008-10-18 02:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013155, 730559, 54645, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, this is a very creative shot for me. Reminds me <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=717592" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bear_music</a>s  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_results.php?CHALLENGE_ID=913" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Overexposed</a> shot.</td>', 'Hmmm, this is a very creative shot for me. Reminds me bear_musics  Overexposed shot.', '2008-10-18 02:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013156, 730510, 54645, '<td valign="top">This is very powerful, but I think the vignette is heavy handed. I''m not sure it was needed! I love the subject and composition. The contrail looks like an abstract laundry line!</td>', 'This is very powerful, but I think the vignette is heavy handed. I''m not sure it was needed! I love the subject and composition. The contrail looks like an abstract laundry line!', '2008-10-18 02:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
