(5013159, 730404, 54645, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photograph. I don''t see how it fits the challenge. Still a 6 for me.</td>', 'Fantastic photograph. I don''t see how it fits the challenge. Still a 6 for me.', '2008-10-18 02:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
