(5013171, 730392, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  The horizon looks tilted but maybe it''s the hills because other verticals look fine.  Good meeting of challenge.</td>', 'Nice colors.  The horizon looks tilted but maybe it''s the hills because other verticals look fine.  Good meeting of challenge.', '2008-10-18 02:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013173, 730335, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good message.  Is this purposely overprocessed?</td>', 'Good message.  Is this purposely overprocessed?', '2008-10-18 03:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013175, 730161, 76430, '<td valign="top">Quaint little cottage. Nice and sharp.  Why isn''t the whole cottage in the picture?</td>', 'Quaint little cottage. Nice and sharp.  Why isn''t the whole cottage in the picture?', '2008-10-18 03:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013177, 730541, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very daring 90 degree angle.  Nice shot definitely showing suburbia.</td>', 'Very daring 90 degree angle.  Nice shot definitely showing suburbia.', '2008-10-18 03:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013178, 730487, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but IMHO it would be better to have the street in focusrather than the foreground.</td>', 'Good idea, but IMHO it would be better to have the street in focusrather than the foreground.', '2008-10-18 03:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013188, 730474, 76430, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential but it''s not very sharp and the sky looks pretty noisy.</td>', 'This has a lot of potential but it''s not very sharp and the sky looks pretty noisy.', '2008-10-18 03:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013324, 730501, 6086, '<td valign="top">i really like the perspective and the mood created by the contrasy b&amp;W effect.</td>', 'i really like the perspective and the mood created by the contrasy b&W effect.', '2008-10-18 08:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013350, 730550, 3936, '<td valign="top">Nice image!  Good focus. Depth of field is very good.  I like that you kept the center stripe in the frame. Had the crop been any tighter, it would have diminished the effect a bit.  That the speed limit sign is readable, is key here.  The angle of the photo helps sell that the speed was too high.  This photo tells a story, which really makes it for me. One of my favorites this week.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Nice image!  Good focus. Depth of field is very good.  I like that you kept the center stripe in the frame. Had the crop been any tighter, it would have diminished the effect a bit.  That the speed limit sign is readable, is key here.  The angle of the photo helps sell that the speed was too high.  This photo tells a story, which really makes it for me. One of my favorites this week.  Very nice work.', '2008-10-18 10:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013383, 730444, 51156, '<td valign="top">Photo does nothing for me</td>', 'Photo does nothing for me', '2008-10-18 11:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013386, 730501, 97509, '<td valign="top">Beautiful perspective.</td>', 'Beautiful perspective.', '2008-10-18 11:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013387, 729104, 97509, '<td valign="top">Really sick photo.  Amazing.</td>', 'Really sick photo.  Amazing.', '2008-10-18 11:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013414, 730508, 76430, '<td valign="top">If the boy and pink pole are the main subject the "crayon" should be fully in the picture.  My attention is more drawn towards the two people talking.  Otherwise, nice suburbia scene.</td>', 'If the boy and pink pole are the main subject the "crayon" should be fully in the picture.  My attention is more drawn towards the two people talking.  Otherwise, nice suburbia scene.', '2008-10-18 12:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013419, 730477, 76430, '<td valign="top">There is no focal point here.  Is it the homes?  The birds?  The fall foliage?  The power lines?  Don''t try to get so much in one shot.  I often try to do that also with poor results.</td>', 'There is no focal point here.  Is it the homes?  The birds?  The fall foliage?  The power lines?  Don''t try to get so much in one shot.  I often try to do that also with poor results.', '2008-10-18 12:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013425, 730427, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m struggling to see the people details here.  It''s a nicely composed shot, but the lighting spoils the subjects.  I would prefer better lighting on the people or else totally silhouette them maybe with the sun directly behind one of them.</td>', 'I''m struggling to see the people details here.  It''s a nicely composed shot, but the lighting spoils the subjects.  I would prefer better lighting on the people or else totally silhouette them maybe with the sun directly behind one of them.', '2008-10-18 12:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013427, 730557, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but it looks overly sharpened, not to the point of fringing but it looks unrealistic in the flowers especially.</td>', 'Good composition, but it looks overly sharpened, not to the point of fringing but it looks unrealistic in the flowers especially.', '2008-10-18 12:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013429, 730304, 76430, '<td valign="top">It looks like a project in progress, thus I suppose the "Genesis" part of the title.  I''d rather see it finished with some stuff on the table and shelves.  I like the lighting other than the blowout above the shelves.</td>', 'It looks like a project in progress, thus I suppose the "Genesis" part of the title.  I''d rather see it finished with some stuff on the table and shelves.  I like the lighting other than the blowout above the shelves.', '2008-10-18 12:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013442, 730432, 75713, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  The sky holds my interest with it''s shades of grays and the way it lights the sign at the bottom. I like the holes in the metal, leading the eye up to the very important message to slow down.  A minor quibble might be to lighten the sign face a bit, but, it might add little to the overall composition.</td>', 'I really like this photo.  The sky holds my interest with it''s shades of grays and the way it lights the sign at the bottom. I like the holes in the metal, leading the eye up to the very important message to slow down.  A minor quibble might be to lighten the sign face a bit, but, it might add little to the overall composition.', '2008-10-18 12:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013448, 730550, 75713, '<td valign="top">A very dramatic photo and suits the challenge well as I am sure that speeding cars pose a real problem in suburbia.  I like that very green tree and good job getting the speed limit sign well lit and in focus.  The lighted window adds a nice touch to your composition. The angle of this shot really works well - a suggestion, and I don''t know if it would improve anything, would be to clone out the lights and the house in the upper left corner - I wonder if it would add to the overall drama?</td>', 'A very dramatic photo and suits the challenge well as I am sure that speeding cars pose a real problem in suburbia.  I like that very green tree and good job getting the speed limit sign well lit and in focus.  The lighted window adds a nice touch to your composition. The angle of this shot really works well - a suggestion, and I don''t know if it would improve anything, would be to clone out the lights and the house in the upper left corner - I wonder if it would add to the overall drama?', '2008-10-18 12:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013451, 730510, 75713, '<td valign="top">My first thought was, Ohh I like this shot - my second thought was, I wouldn''t want to live there though.. they are copies of each other.. what a good job you did in pp.  The grass and the sky are the same shades of grays.. the textures are wonderful.. might be interesting if the house at the end wasn''t there to see them meet.. overall a good composition that benefited from your post processing skills.</td>', 'My first thought was, Ohh I like this shot - my second thought was, I wouldn''t want to live there though.. they are copies of each other.. what a good job you did in pp.  The grass and the sky are the same shades of grays.. the textures are wonderful.. might be interesting if the house at the end wasn''t there to see them meet.. overall a good composition that benefited from your post processing skills.', '2008-10-18 12:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013455, 730392, 75713, '<td valign="top">At first I was a little taken back by the roof and then I saw that it added balance to your photo.  I like how you processed this shot.  The sky is great, I like how you kept detail in each house right back to the horizon.  Has a 50''s feeling minus the car.  Nice job.</td>', 'At first I was a little taken back by the roof and then I saw that it added balance to your photo.  I like how you processed this shot.  The sky is great, I like how you kept detail in each house right back to the horizon.  Has a 50''s feeling minus the car.  Nice job.', '2008-10-18 12:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013456, 730404, 75713, '<td valign="top">Great tonal range in this photo, your title suits this shot well.  Your pp is excellent. The oof b/g is just the right degree of oof, it adds interest as you can still tell what each item is but they don''t compete with the interesting items on the table.  Hope that makes sense.  You have the perfect blacks, perfect whites and all the shades of grays inbetween.  Great job.</td>', 'Great tonal range in this photo, your title suits this shot well.  Your pp is excellent. The oof b/g is just the right degree of oof, it adds interest as you can still tell what each item is but they don''t compete with the interesting items on the table.  Hope that makes sense.  You have the perfect blacks, perfect whites and all the shades of grays inbetween.  Great job.', '2008-10-18 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013457, 730553, 75713, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this shot.. the deer is an added bonus.. might not be what everyone thinks suburbia is but the people in the wagon seal it for me (the cars in back help too). The beautiful fall foliage make a perfect background and your pp really brought out how the same colors are repeated throughout your composition.</td>', 'I love the colors in this shot.. the deer is an added bonus.. might not be what everyone thinks suburbia is but the people in the wagon seal it for me (the cars in back help too). The beautiful fall foliage make a perfect background and your pp really brought out how the same colors are repeated throughout your composition.', '2008-10-18 12:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013460, 730497, 75713, '<td valign="top">Coming back to bump this shot. <br/> <br/>I like your pp on this, you made what could have been a mundane shot interesting.</td>', 'Coming back to bump this shot.  I like your pp on this, you made what could have been a mundane shot interesting.', '2008-10-18 13:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013511, 730175, 75713, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful sky, interesting textures abound - love the colors in the buildings, they echo the colors in the sky - nicely done.</td>', 'What a wonderful sky, interesting textures abound - love the colors in the buildings, they echo the colors in the sky - nicely done.', '2008-10-18 13:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013535, 730477, 75713, '<td valign="top">I like the houses on the hill and the realism the power line looming over them brings to this shot. The verdict is still out on the potential damage these power lines cause to the health of those living below them. I don''t if you planned on making that kind of statment but I like it. I also like your pp on the houses, making them kind of glow with surreal colors. The birds in the sky, IMHO, don''t add to your composition as they are too close together and just too out of focus.  I like the sploches of color of the foilage in the hills.</td>', 'I like the houses on the hill and the realism the power line looming over them brings to this shot. The verdict is still out on the potential damage these power lines cause to the health of those living below them. I don''t if you planned on making that kind of statment but I like it. I also like your pp on the houses, making them kind of glow with surreal colors. The birds in the sky, IMHO, don''t add to your composition as they are too close together and just too out of focus.  I like the sploches of color of the foilage in the hills.', '2008-10-18 13:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013558, 730274, 75713, '<td valign="top">Wonderful crisp focus on the child playing in the grass. like the oof b/g - great title, really suits the little girl''s expression.</td>', 'Wonderful crisp focus on the child playing in the grass. like the oof b/g - great title, really suits the little girl''s expression.', '2008-10-18 13:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013562, 730542, 75713, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge.. great title.. I like the darkened sky, it gives a feeling that the day is over and somewhere a child is wailing for their lost toy.. hope the parents know about this lost and found site :)</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge.. great title.. I like the darkened sky, it gives a feeling that the day is over and somewhere a child is wailing for their lost toy.. hope the parents know about this lost and found site :)', '2008-10-18 14:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013568, 730533, 75713, '<td valign="top">Ohhh this photo cracked me up.. toooooo funny.. the legs, it''s all in the legs!  Wait, it''s all in the slippers.. oh I can''t make up my mind, it''s the whole thing.. the rollers, the velour skirt, the desperately needing a paint job.. the smiling dog that scares the bejakers out of me.. you did it all.. put the T in tacky in the best way possible and photographed the heck out of it!</td>', 'Ohhh this photo cracked me up.. toooooo funny.. the legs, it''s all in the legs!  Wait, it''s all in the slippers.. oh I can''t make up my mind, it''s the whole thing.. the rollers, the velour skirt, the desperately needing a paint job.. the smiling dog that scares the bejakers out of me.. you did it all.. put the T in tacky in the best way possible and photographed the heck out of it!', '2008-10-18 14:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013570, 730282, 1031, '<td valign="top">I really like the effect the oddly-trimmed and tilted tree gives to the perspective.</td>', 'I really like the effect the oddly-trimmed and tilted tree gives to the perspective.', '2008-10-18 14:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013573, 730175, 1031, '<td valign="top">That cloud on the horizon looks like a mouse eating a piece of cheese :-)<br/> <br/>I like the soft coloration.<br/> <br/>(Darn typos!)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-21 12:33:14.</i></td>', 'That cloud on the horizon looks like a mouse eating a piece of cheese :-) I like the soft coloration. (Darn typos!)', '2008-10-18 14:29:37.000000', '2008-10-21 13:33:14.000000', 1),
(5013576, 730479, 75713, '<td valign="top">This photo has wonderful light.. the sky is dramatic - the shadows fortelling a storm indeed.. wonderful pp - great colors - really like how you left the strip of lighter pavement in the forground with the patch of green in the right corner.. well done.</td>', 'This photo has wonderful light.. the sky is dramatic - the shadows fortelling a storm indeed.. wonderful pp - great colors - really like how you left the strip of lighter pavement in the forground with the patch of green in the right corner.. well done.', '2008-10-18 14:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013578, 730088, 1031, '<td valign="top">If I ever get to design a suburb, the temptation to lay out the streets to spell out "something" visible from the air would be hard to resist ... :-)<br/> <br/>Nice contrast of finished and prospective developments.</td>', 'If I ever get to design a suburb, the temptation to lay out the streets to spell out "something" visible from the air would be hard to resist ... :-) Nice contrast of finished and prospective developments.', '2008-10-18 14:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013580, 730541, 1031, '<td valign="top">I was hoping someone would quote that song. :-)</td>', 'I was hoping someone would quote that song. :-)', '2008-10-18 14:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013609, 730157, 75713, '<td valign="top">This photo breaks me up.. for some reason I just want to save the poor little flower from it''s death.. if that was the last flower on the planet, or an endangered species, it would not be facing such a terrible fate.. awww well  :)   nice focus, great oof b/g - the slightly blown patch in the upper right hand corner grabs my eye a bit but nicely composed and suits the challenge well as mowing the lawn of these pesky weeds is certainly something people in suburbia can relate to.</td>', 'This photo breaks me up.. for some reason I just want to save the poor little flower from it''s death.. if that was the last flower on the planet, or an endangered species, it would not be facing such a terrible fate.. awww well  :)   nice focus, great oof b/g - the slightly blown patch in the upper right hand corner grabs my eye a bit but nicely composed and suits the challenge well as mowing the lawn of these pesky weeds is certainly something people in suburbia can relate to.', '2008-10-18 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013618, 730559, 75713, '<td valign="top">I am a fan of light and shadow.. this has both.. I like the angle you shot this from, I like the reflection of light on the ceiling and the pattern the blinds made on the wall .. the title confuses me a bit as the bed looks more like someone was tossing and turning ... if there were a glass of wine maybe.. a satin comforter.. even some pills on the night stand.. leading to me thinking of the old trueism of escaping from the boredom of life in suburbia.. just my take on it however.<br/> <br/>back to bump</td>', 'I am a fan of light and shadow.. this has both.. I like the angle you shot this from, I like the reflection of light on the ceiling and the pattern the blinds made on the wall .. the title confuses me a bit as the bed looks more like someone was tossing and turning ... if there were a glass of wine maybe.. a satin comforter.. even some pills on the night stand.. leading to me thinking of the old trueism of escaping from the boredom of life in suburbia.. just my take on it however. back to bump', '2008-10-18 14:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013622, 730562, 75713, '<td valign="top">A nice take on the challenge.. I like the angle you shot this from.. I always enjoy lines in photos.. While I like the starkness of the pure whites and blacks, I think some grays would add more texture in the blacked out areas and give more detail in the hardware on the fence.. giving this photo a broader tonal range. However, that is a personal decision and up to you as the photographer.</td>', 'A nice take on the challenge.. I like the angle you shot this from.. I always enjoy lines in photos.. While I like the starkness of the pure whites and blacks, I think some grays would add more texture in the blacked out areas and give more detail in the hardware on the fence.. giving this photo a broader tonal range. However, that is a personal decision and up to you as the photographer.', '2008-10-18 14:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013686, 729104, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo is kinda - well, I don''t know. It''s just not...vivid? Anyway, I think that aspect of it gives it an even better quality to match the challenge and your title. It seems very ironic, ''Park and Ride'' yet there are no cars in the lot - only a solitaire person waiting...10</td>', 'The photo is kinda - well, I don''t know. It''s just not...vivid? Anyway, I think that aspect of it gives it an even better quality to match the challenge and your title. It seems very ironic, ''Park and Ride'' yet there are no cars in the lot - only a solitaire person waiting...10', '2008-10-18 16:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013687, 730435, 62187, '<td valign="top">Screams ''Suburbia'' to me. The edit is very effective bringing out the main subject. 10</td>', 'Screams ''Suburbia'' to me. The edit is very effective bringing out the main subject. 10', '2008-10-18 16:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5013689, 730555, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very cartoonish and surreal looking. I think the tilted crop gives an angle of interest to what would probably be ordinary looking: 10</td>', 'Very cartoonish and surreal looking. I think the tilted crop gives an angle of interest to what would probably be ordinary looking: 10', '2008-10-18 16:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
