(5014790, 730229, 60495, '<td valign="top">If this was truly a sububan path there would be a pick up after your dog sign and I do not see a sign. I need proof it is suburban to give a decent score.</td>', 'If this was truly a sububan path there would be a pick up after your dog sign and I do not see a sign. I need proof it is suburban to give a decent score.', '2008-10-19 17:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
