(5014892, 730392, 90474, '<td valign="top">The horizon is too near the center of the frame. The wedge of roof and the shadow detracts slightly from the photo, but I realize that you have to work with the windows that are available. I rally like the exposure and processing.</td>', 'The horizon is too near the center of the frame. The wedge of roof and the shadow detracts slightly from the photo, but I realize that you have to work with the windows that are available. I rally like the exposure and processing.', '2008-10-19 19:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014908, 730164, 86316, '<td valign="top">LOL one of my favourites so far. Awesome remake :) 9</td>', 'LOL one of my favourites so far. Awesome remake :) 9', '2008-10-19 20:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014910, 730404, 86316, '<td valign="top">I love this, nice b&amp;w and interesting subject. 9</td>', 'I love this, nice b&w and interesting subject. 9', '2008-10-19 20:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014912, 730566, 12076, '<td valign="top">Very nice...</td>', 'Very nice...', '2008-10-19 20:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014916, 730282, 90474, '<td valign="top">I''m an old stick in the mud, so I can''t see what the tilt does to the photo.  All the water is going to run out from under the boats.</td>', 'I''m an old stick in the mud, so I can''t see what the tilt does to the photo.  All the water is going to run out from under the boats.', '2008-10-19 20:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014927, 730550, 8860, '<td valign="top">Smart, graphical looking shot. Like the tilt, colouring and composition here - perhaps not enough suburbia for some, but it''s quite clear to me what the context is.</td>', 'Smart, graphical looking shot. Like the tilt, colouring and composition here - perhaps not enough suburbia for some, but it''s quite clear to me what the context is.', '2008-10-19 20:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014928, 730510, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing - as it looks like a street covered in lawn! Very surreal and what a weirdly fun looking place to kick a football. I bet this is a fantastic place for kids to play with each other. It doesn''t get safer than this. Great, social BBQs too.<br/> <br/>Your shot is well chosen and shot. The con trail somehow helps too. Good luck.<br/> <br/>My favourite in the challenge I think, and it will tick many voters'' boxes too.</td>', 'Very intriguing - as it looks like a street covered in lawn! Very surreal and what a weirdly fun looking place to kick a football. I bet this is a fantastic place for kids to play with each other. It doesn''t get safer than this. Great, social BBQs too. Your shot is well chosen and shot. The con trail somehow helps too. Good luck. My favourite in the challenge I think, and it will tick many voters'' boxes too.', '2008-10-19 20:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014932, 730557, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint - strong composition with the interest increased by the absence of a face. Just a cool shot really.</td>', 'Great viewpoint - strong composition with the interest increased by the absence of a face. Just a cool shot really.', '2008-10-19 20:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014968, 730456, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot except for the vertical green railing support that''s almost centered.  I would have liked it much better if you stepped a foot, make that 30cm, to the right.  Also since it''s advanced editing the bluish tint on the car and other stuff in the background may have looked better toned down.</td>', 'I like this a lot except for the vertical green railing support that''s almost centered.  I would have liked it much better if you stepped a foot, make that 30cm, to the right.  Also since it''s advanced editing the bluish tint on the car and other stuff in the background may have looked better toned down.', '2008-10-19 21:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014969, 730104, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m struggling with relating this to suburbia.  It looks like an urban harbour. The bicycles are definitely the main elements of interest. I like how it''s divided horizontally in the thirds lines, but there is a lot of negative space in the bottom half.  The water line appears to be tilted, but it''s probably an illusion from the slant of the hillside.</td>', 'I''m struggling with relating this to suburbia.  It looks like an urban harbour. The bicycles are definitely the main elements of interest. I like how it''s divided horizontally in the thirds lines, but there is a lot of negative space in the bottom half.  The water line appears to be tilted, but it''s probably an illusion from the slant of the hillside.', '2008-10-19 21:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014973, 730456, 83633, '<td valign="top">This image popped off the screen above all the others</td>', 'This image popped off the screen above all the others', '2008-10-19 22:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5014986, 730498, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice candid, but too much backside.</td>', 'Nice candid, but too much backside.', '2008-10-19 22:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
