(5015116, 730533, 67697, '<td valign="top">I have to say that I am quite thankful that my neighbors do not look like this but I am sure that someone in this city has to look like you :D  Gritty suburbia - love it!</td>', 'I have to say that I am quite thankful that my neighbors do not look like this but I am sure that someone in this city has to look like you :D  Gritty suburbia - love it!', '2008-10-19 23:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
