(5015119, 730435, 67697, '<td valign="top">Construction guys - for sure a necessary part of the suburbs.  Kudos to you for getting up there with him.  Great pose.  I don''t like the bright area to the right but I doubt there was much you could do about that :D</td>', 'Construction guys - for sure a necessary part of the suburbs.  Kudos to you for getting up there with him.  Great pose.  I don''t like the bright area to the right but I doubt there was much you could do about that :D', '2008-10-19 23:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5015122, 730528, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like how the house is framed by fall leaves.  We have interesting old homes like this in our area too.</td>', 'I like how the house is framed by fall leaves.  We have interesting old homes like this in our area too.', '2008-10-19 23:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
