(5015126, 729646, 67697, '<td valign="top">My parents had a house in a place that looked just like this!  I remember the big open backyards (between new developments) and the people trying to squeeze in trees where they could.  Just a little too much sharpening for my taste a you can see the white outlines around the rooftops.  Good idea for the challenge.</td>', 'My parents had a house in a place that looked just like this!  I remember the big open backyards (between new developments) and the people trying to squeeze in trees where they could.  Just a little too much sharpening for my taste a you can see the white outlines around the rooftops.  Good idea for the challenge.', '2008-10-19 23:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
