(5015218, 730562, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=75713" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Saker</a>''s interpretation - she gave you a very good critique.  This is a great idea for the challenge.  White picket fences belong in suburbia, don''t they?  I always find it hard to shoot white.  Your fence pops out very well here.  Nice and bright!</td>', 'I like  Saker''s interpretation - she gave you a very good critique.  This is a great idea for the challenge.  White picket fences belong in suburbia, don''t they?  I always find it hard to shoot white.  Your fence pops out very well here.  Nice and bright!', '2008-10-20 01:15:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5015221, 730477, 67697, '<td valign="top">I really liked this idea - kind of reminded me of something Hitchcock lol.  You probably could not do much about this given the distance, but I wanted to see a closer view of that town - it looks so quaint, all tucked into the hillside like that.  I bet it is a beautiful place to see in the fall!</td>', 'I really liked this idea - kind of reminded me of something Hitchcock lol.  You probably could not do much about this given the distance, but I wanted to see a closer view of that town - it looks so quaint, all tucked into the hillside like that.  I bet it is a beautiful place to see in the fall!', '2008-10-20 01:17:02.000000', NULL, 0),
