(5015585, 730240, 70661, '<td valign="top">I really like this! Great processing! Very fun!</td>', 'I really like this! Great processing! Very fun!', '2008-10-20 08:05:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5015595, 730164, 82707, '<td valign="top">Oh!! Fabulous image!  I love that your images make me laugh!  Congrats on another Blue!  Now if you have any control over the ''little woman'' ...who frankly scares the ...bejeepwers... outta me, with that stare!  Maybe she could track down and take care of those two voters that thought it was worth a 1!<br/> <br/>PS:  I can''t wait to see what you do with your idea of doing an image with the two and a half children.....:)</td>', 'Oh!! Fabulous image!  I love that your images make me laugh!  Congrats on another Blue!  Now if you have any control over the ''little woman'' ...who frankly scares the ...bejeepwers... outta me, with that stare!  Maybe she could track down and take care of those two voters that thought it was worth a 1! PS:  I can''t wait to see what you do with your idea of doing an image with the two and a half children.....:)', '2008-10-20 08:12:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5015603, 730511, 30982, '<td valign="top">Almost an eerie Stepford kinda thing going on with even odder undertones (namely the man''s hand, the little girl).  Quite an intriguing technique, I must say!</td>', 'Almost an eerie Stepford kinda thing going on with even odder undertones (namely the man''s hand, the little girl).  Quite an intriguing technique, I must say!', '2008-10-20 08:26:14.000000', NULL, 0),
