(5015640, 730533, 18450, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot Judi! Fantastic pose (and scowl, he''s adorable), love the grin on Misty''s face!</td>', 'Brilliant shot Judi! Fantastic pose (and scowl, he''s adorable), love the grin on Misty''s face!', '2008-10-20 08:56:48.000000', NULL, 0),
