(5015977, 730164, 68947, '<td valign="top">Congrats Tim!  Nicely done.  I think that you''re your own best subject! You seem to bring yourself luck! ;)<br/> <br/>PS:  The Tutu would have added a little something!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-20 11:45:33.</i></td>', 'Congrats Tim!  Nicely done.  I think that you''re your own best subject! You seem to bring yourself luck! ;) PS:  The Tutu would have added a little something!', '2008-10-20 12:43:54.000000', '2008-10-20 12:45:33.000000', 0),
