(5015979, 730394, 68947, '<td valign="top">Congrats on this shot.  Can''t add much else to my comment during challenge voting.  <br/> <br/>I did, however question the entry at first.  I looked at the left hand side and saw a street and had to wonder whether this was the burbs or a city park.  However, I did think about it and figured that there are parks in suburbia.  <br/> <br/>Good going and congrats on the ribbon! Well done:)</td>', 'Congrats on this shot.  Can''t add much else to my comment during challenge voting.   I did, however question the entry at first.  I looked at the left hand side and saw a street and had to wonder whether this was the burbs or a city park.  However, I did think about it and figured that there are parks in suburbia.   Good going and congrats on the ribbon! Well done:)', '2008-10-20 12:48:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5015983, 730510, 68947, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon!  It certainly typifies suburbia style housing. It wasn''t one of my all time faves (to be honest) in this challenge, but it did bring the essence of different forms of suburbia with it.</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon!  It certainly typifies suburbia style housing. It wasn''t one of my all time faves (to be honest) in this challenge, but it did bring the essence of different forms of suburbia with it.', '2008-10-20 12:52:45.000000', NULL, 0),
