(5017247, 730111, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> Not sure it meets the challenge very well, but that aside, this does have a certain appeal. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Guess I could elaborate... <br/> <br/>This was a hard challenge, I think. That''s why I sat out. Suburban, by definition, is a very local concept -- a very personal one, perhaps, too. Most of the entires that were soundly suburban were soundly boring. Yours was neither in my opinion. <br/> <br/>I gave this a five, which neither helped you nor hurt you, it looks like. I thought there was something nostalgic about it -- it has the look and feel of an old photo. I just had trouble making the suburban connection was all.</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: Not sure it meets the challenge very well, but that aside, this does have a certain appeal.   Guess I could elaborate...  This was a hard challenge, I think. That''s why I sat out. Suburban, by definition, is a very local concept -- a very personal one, perhaps, too. Most of the entires that were soundly suburban were soundly boring. Yours was neither in my opinion.  I gave this a five, which neither helped you nor hurt you, it looks like. I thought there was something nostalgic about it -- it has the look and feel of an old photo. I just had trouble making the suburban connection was all.', '2008-10-20 22:53:47.000000', NULL, 0),
