(5054499, 729442, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like a club ride - and as I know from experience, sometimes you deal with suburbia on club rides.  :-)  We''d generally head out (in cars) to the middle of nowhere in Texas to avoid the whole suburbia issue, though our biggest problem was with cars and their drivers, not the surroundings.  And you know I agree 100% with you about the problems of photographing the way things really are and trying to get votes!</td>', 'Looks like a club ride - and as I know from experience, sometimes you deal with suburbia on club rides.  :-)  We''d generally head out (in cars) to the middle of nowhere in Texas to avoid the whole suburbia issue, though our biggest problem was with cars and their drivers, not the surroundings.  And you know I agree 100% with you about the problems of photographing the way things really are and trying to get votes!', '2008-11-10 02:52:52.000000', NULL, 0),
