(6064474, 730533, 68947, '<td valign="top">I just re-visited this one and I''m STILL laughing!  I can imagine your hubby''s horror at having this one do so well!  I''m sure he was happy for you but, mortified at the same time.  Your hubby is as good a sport as mine, who sat out in the snow with a guitar for me, freezing his rear off (literally), dressed in a Hawaian short sleeved shirt for the Led Zeppelin challenge way back.  He also did the cross dressing shot for me BUT...wouldn''t let me put his face into the shot LOL!  <br/> <br/>Made me chuckle again. :)</td>', 'I just re-visited this one and I''m STILL laughing!  I can imagine your hubby''s horror at having this one do so well!  I''m sure he was happy for you but, mortified at the same time.  Your hubby is as good a sport as mine, who sat out in the snow with a guitar for me, freezing his rear off (literally), dressed in a Hawaian short sleeved shirt for the Led Zeppelin challenge way back.  He also did the cross dressing shot for me BUT...wouldn''t let me put his face into the shot LOL!   Made me chuckle again. :)', '2010-06-21 12:20:21.000000', NULL, 0),
